  "notable_quotes": [
    "Framework assembly is highly sensitive to coordination orientation; small differences can produce a different topology or even prevent crystallization.",
    "CPM-63m and CPM-63a illustrate this strategy: Zn2(RCOO)4 paddlewheels and bent FDC2− form neutral kagome layers that are pillared by bent MTZ− or ATZ− ligands.",
    "Out-of-alignment coordination sites between adjacent corrugated layers formed by bent in-layer ligands can be connected using a second ligand with a matching bent angle."
